# PART H — ADD PG PROPERTY AND APPROVAL

## 33. Property registration business workflow

This is a critical business requirement.

The owner must first register the overall PG property.

The owner must not be required to configure rooms, beds, bathrooms, sharing options, or rent during initial registration.

Workflow:

1. Owner creates an account.
2. Owner accesses dashboard.
3. Owner adds PG property.
4. Owner captures property location.
5. Owner uploads property photographs.
6. Owner submits for approval.
7. Super Admin verifies property and location.
8. Property is approved.
9. Owner unlocks property management.
10. Owner configures floors, rooms, bathrooms, beds, rent, and other operations.
11. Owner may purchase the official public listing entitlement in a future phase.
12. Eligible property becomes publicly discoverable.

The official listing fee will be ₹299 per property under the future Basic listing model.

Do not integrate real payment collection for this fee during the initial implementation.

